label Greeting
# [signal arg="refresh_desires"]
if {Transaction_GreetingVar} <= 50:
	TK: Yo, fam! This heat is a total vibe killer for the vlog. I need to cool down.
else:
	TK: Hey! Just got back from scouting some 'Hidden Gems'. Immaculate views, but man, I'm drained.
[end_timeline]

label Talk
if {Transaction_TalkVar} <= 50:
	TK: Hook me up with a {Transaction_ItemWants}? [pause=0.4] I need to rehydrate before my battery hits 1%.
else:
	TK: Give me your best {Transaction_ItemWants}. [pause=0.5] Aesthetic doesn't mean much if the explorer is starving, right?
- Just a sec, fam.
	TK: Bet. I'll just check my notifications while I wait.
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry, TK, we're fresh out of stock.
	TK: Oof. [pause=0.4] Major L for the vlog. [pause=0.3] Sige, I'll try the next village. Stay fresh!
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[signal arg="story_success"]
	[end_timeline]


label Partial
TK: Bet. [pause=0.3] Still waiting on that {Transaction_ItemWants} though, don't leave me hanging!
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_SatisfyVar} <= 50:
	TK: Based. [pause=0.4] This is going straight into the 'Essential Gear' highlight.
else:
	TK: Phew! [pause=0.5] Feeling the energy again. Thanks for the restock, fam.
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
if {Transaction_WrongItemVar} <= 50:
	TK: Uh, fam? This isn't on the script. I was looking for the {Transaction_ItemWants}.
else:
	TK: Wrong vibe, man. [pause=0.4] This isn't the {Transaction_ItemWants} I dropped the pin for.
[end_timeline]